 verificâ chest sît, par chel nuie nol ven discjariât o instalât.','The service could not reach your site. A firewall, security plugin or host rule is probably blocking the request; please allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.'=>'Il servizi nol à rivât a contatâ il to sît. Probabilmentri un firewall, un plugin di sigurece o une regule dal host al bloche la richieste; permet lis richiestis a /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.','Your site took too long to answer. Please try again later, and check that your host is not too slow or overloaded.'=>'Il to sît al à metût masse timp a rispuindi. Prove di gnûf plui tart e controle che il to host no sedi masse lent o sorecjamât.','Your site answered, but not with what was expected. The REST API may be rewritten by another plugin, or that endpoint may be cached; please exclude /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge from caching and rewriting.'=>'Il to sît al à rispuindût, ma no cun ce che si spietave. La REST API e podarès jessi riscrite di un altri plugin, o chel endpoint al podarès jessi in cache; escludi /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge de cache e de riscriture.','Please check that your site can be reached from the internet, then try again.'=>'Controle che il to sît al sedi rivabil di internet, dopo prove di gnûf.','Re-verify'=>'Verifiche di gnûf','This site is over the size the service accepts in one sync, so some items were left out: %1$d components and %2$d locales.'=>'Chest sît al passe la dimension che il servizi al acete intune sole sincronizazion, duncje cualchi element al è stât lassât fûr: %1$d components e %2$d lenghis.','This site is verified.'=>'Chest sît al è verificât.','Registration restarted.'=>'Regjistrazion inviade di gnûf.','Sync complete.'=>'Sincronizazion completade.','Babilim is enabling and checking this site… Reload this page or wait for the scheduled check to finish.'=>'Babilim al sta ativant e controlant chest sît… Torne a cjamâ cheste pagjine o spiete che il control programât al finissi.','Babilim could not finish enabling (%1$s): %2$s'=>'Babilim nol à rivât a completâ l\'ativazion (%1$s): %2$s','A host that serves only one PHP request at a time cannot complete this step.'=>'Un host che al servis dome une richieste PHP par volte nol pues completâ chest pas.','Babilim is enabled: this site is verified and %d component was found.'=>'Babilim al è ativât: chest sît al è verificât e al è stât cjatât %d component.' . "\0" . 'Babilim al è ativât: chest sît al è verificât e a son stâts cjatâts %d components.','Babilim is disabled. Nothing more is sent; translations already installed keep working.'=>'Babilim al è disativât. No si mande plui nuie; lis traduzions za instaladis a continuin a funzionâ.','Supplementary translation index rebuilt.'=>'Indis des traduzions supplementârs ricostruît.','Sweep complete: %d file deleted.'=>'Analisi completade: %d file eliminât.' . "\0" . 'Analisi completade: %d files eliminâts.','Removed %d installed component.'=>'Gjavât %d component instalât.' . "\0" . 'Gjavâts %d components instalâts.','Automatic installs are now off; turn them on again in the settings if you want them.'=>'Lis instalazions automatichis a son disativadis; ative-lis di gnûf tes impostazions se lis desideris.','Babilim finds the plugins and themes on this site that have no translation for your language and installs one for each.'=>'Babilim al cjate i plugins e i temis di chest sît che no àn une traduzion pe tô lenghe e ne instale une par ognidun.','Languages found on this site: %s.'=>'Lenghis cjatadis su chest sît: %s.','Available translations can be installed with one click, and missing ones can be requested. After that, new translations and updates are installed automatically (on the free plan, only for plugins and themes that already use a free slot).'=>'Lis traduzions disponibilis si puedin instalâ cuntun clic e chês che a mancjin si puedin domandâ. Dopo di chest, lis gnovis traduzions e i inzornaments a vegnin instalâts in maniere automatiche (tal plan gratuit, dome