=>'Indaûr','To translate this component, Babilim needs its source.'=>'Par tradusi chest component, Babilim al à bisugne de sô font.','The entire plugin or theme directory of %1$s (version %2$s) will be uploaded to Babilim.'=>'La intière cartele dal plugin o dal teme di %1$s (version %2$s) e vignarà cjamade sù su Babilim.','If that directory contains keys, logs or customer data, they will be uploaded too. The service removes common sensitive files (configuration, environment, database dumps, logs, keys) but cannot guarantee it finds everything.'=>'Se cheste cartele e conten clâfs, regjistris o dâts dai clients, a vignaran cjamâts sù ancje chei. Il servizi al gjave i file sensibii plui comuns (configurazion, ambient, copiis dal database, regjistris, clâfs) ma nol pues garantî di cjatâjuducj.','The upload is kept until you ask Babilim to delete it.'=>'Il cjariament al ven tignût fintremai che no domandis a Babilim di eliminâlu.','It is stored by the service\'s hosting provider and processed by AI models to produce the translation.'=>'Al ven memorizât dal furnidôr di hosting dal servizi e elaborât di modei di IA par produsi la traduzion.','The original text and the translations made from it will be provided to other sites that install the same version.'=>'Il test origjinâl e lis traduzions fatis di chel a vignaran dadis a altris sîts che a instalin la stesse version.','By continuing you confirm that you have the right to upload this component.'=>'Se tu continuis, tu confermis di vê il derit di cjamâ sù chest component.','Upload and request'=>'Cjame sù e domande','Uploading…'=>'Cjamament sù…','Cancel'=>'Anule','Uploading'=>'Cjamament sù','There is no upload in progress.'=>'Nol è nissun cjariament in cors.','Uploading part %1$d of %2$d…'=>'Cjamament sù de part %1$d di %2$d…','Continue'=>'Continue','Confirm'=>'Conferme','Remove'=>'Gjave','Roll back'=>'Ripristine la version precedente','Nothing to confirm.'=>'Nuie di confermâ.','Choose a language'=>'Sielç une lenghe','Roll 